{
  "summary": "The experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation, comparing it to the pca_n2000 encoder used in config_003. Validation accuracy (0.6501) and F1 (0.6275) are higher than the pca_n2000 baseline (0.5907 and 0.5727), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance in multiprofile configurations. Uncertainty remains about whether other factors, such as aggregation methods or fusion strategies, could further impact results."
}

